WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:04.891
Roxy glared at Boulder Bill. "This fight isn't over!"

2
00:00:04.892 --> 00:00:07.207
She flew back down the mountain.

3
00:00:07.208 --> 00:00:10.766
Smoke and flames filled the forest.

4
00:00:10.767 --> 00:00:13.872
"I'll use my freeze breath." Roxy got ready . . .

5
00:00:13.873 --> 00:00:16.929
"Help!" someone cried.

6
00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:19.295
"Oh no!" Roxy said.

7
00:00:19.296 --> 00:00:21.509
"There are people in the forest!

8
00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:24.258
My freeze breath will freeze them!"

9
00:00:24.259 --> 00:00:26.838
Roxy flew into the burning forest.

10
00:00:26.839 --> 00:00:31.421
She heard more people.

11
00:00:31.422 --> 00:00:34.242
A sign read Grand Peak Campground.

12
00:00:34.243 --> 00:00:40.603
Roxy gulped. "There must be a lot of campers trapped in this forest fire!"

13
00:00:40.604 --> 00:00:42.588
She found one family.

14
00:00:42.589 --> 00:00:45.974
"Rocket Girl!" a boy cheered.

15
00:00:45.975 --> 00:00:50.726
"Everyone, grab hands!" Roxy took the mom's hand.

16
00:00:50.727 --> 00:00:53.808
She flew them out of the forest.

17
00:00:53.809 --> 00:00:56.296
She saved a few more families.

18
00:00:56.297 --> 00:00:59.653
Then she went back for the last one.

19
00:00:59.654 --> 00:01:03.384
"Help us, Rocket Girl!" a man shouted.

20
00:01:03.385 --> 00:01:05.769
Roxy saw him peeking out of a tent.

21
00:01:05.770 --> 00:01:08.704
Crack! A burning tree fell.

22
00:01:08.705 --> 00:01:11.157
It was going to land on the tent!

23
00:01:11.158 --> 00:01:14.555
Suddenly a huge monster appeared from the smoke.

24
00:01:14.556 --> 00:01:19.333
"Oh no!" Roxy cried. "It's Boulder Bill!"

25
00:01:19.334 --> 00:01:21.853
Bill leaned over the tent and blocked the tree.

26
00:01:21.854 --> 00:01:23.643
It broke over his back.

27
00:01:23.644 --> 00:01:26.500
He grabbed the people and ran fast.

28
00:01:26.501 --> 00:01:30.007
"What are you doing?" Roxy asked.

29
00:01:30.008 --> 00:01:35.892
"I'm helping!" Bill said.

30
00:01:35.893 --> 00:01:38.785
Now everyone was safe.

31
00:01:38.786 --> 00:01:41.136
Roxy blew her freeze breath.

32
00:01:41.137 --> 00:01:43.678
The flames quickly died down.

33
00:01:43.679 --> 00:01:47.058
Smoke drifted from the burnt trees.

34
00:01:47.059 --> 00:01:49.970
"The fire is out!" a woman said.

35
00:01:49.971 --> 00:01:52.303
"Thanks to Rocket Girl!"

36
00:01:52.304 --> 00:01:56.923
"And Boulder Bill!" a boy said. "He's a hero too!"

37
00:01:56.924 --> 00:01:59.505
Boulder Bill looked surprised.

38
00:01:59.506 --> 00:02:01.378
Then he turned to Roxy.

39
00:02:01.379 --> 00:02:03.122
"I'm sorry I fought you.

40
00:02:03.123 --> 00:02:07.114
I was just mad that I didn't reach the summit of Grand Peak."

41
00:02:07.115 --> 00:02:11.915
Roxy grinned. "You reached the summit during our fight."

42
00:02:11.916 --> 00:02:16.194
Boulder Bill chuckled. "Oh yeah!"

43
00:02:16.195 --> 00:02:23.909
An army helicopter landed nearby.

44
00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:29.225
Dr. Chen stepped out.

45
00:02:29.226 --> 00:02:31.957
"Hey, Dr. Chen," Roxy said.

46
00:02:31.958 --> 00:02:34.984
"Hi, Rocket Girl," Dr. Chen said.

47
00:02:34.985 --> 00:02:36.910
Then she looked at Bill.

48
00:02:36.911 --> 00:02:40.886
She held up a device. It beeped.

49
00:02:40.887 --> 00:02:44.294
"That's just what I expected," Dr. Chen said.

50
00:02:44.295 --> 00:02:47.281
"You were infected with a mysterious energy.

51
00:02:47.282 --> 00:02:51.870
It's the same energy that came from the geyser a while ago."

52
00:02:51.871 --> 00:02:53.972
Bill scratched his head.

53
00:02:53.973 --> 00:02:59.330
"I picked up a glowing rock on Grand Peak yesterday.

54
00:02:59.331 --> 00:03:02.493
The next thing I knew, I was like this!"

55
00:03:02.494 --> 00:03:06.614
Dr. Chen smiled. "I can cure you."

56
00:03:06.615 --> 00:03:08.426
Bill tapped his chin.

57
00:03:08.427 --> 00:03:11.981
"No thanks. I want to stay this way and live in the park.

58
00:03:11.982 --> 00:03:13.700
I'll help people here."

59
00:03:13.701 --> 00:03:17.272
Roxy gave him a funny look. "Really?"

60
00:03:17.273 --> 00:03:20.093
Boulder Bill looked at the campers and nodded.

61
00:03:20.094 --> 00:03:23.570
"Yep! Yesterday I was just Bill.

62
00:03:23.571 --> 00:03:27.923
But now I'm Boulder Bill—a hero!"

